            "text": "/-- **`S_d(M) = ∑_{a ≤ M} H_d(a) m(M/a)`**, `m(K) = ∑_{b ≤ K} μ(b)/b`. -/\ntheorem Sd_eq (d M : ℕ) :\n    Sd d M = ∑ a ∈ Icc 1 M, Hd d a * ∑ b ∈ Icc 1 (M / a), (μ b : ℝ) / b := by\n  have h := sum_Ioc_mul_eq_sum_sum (Hd d) Mu M\n  rw [Hd_mul_Mu] at h\n  exact h",
